<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Feb 13.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Feb 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE) 380 CST    180 CST     MDO	GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   92/94	98/99	UNQ	185/187</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  93/97	98/102     185/190  195/200</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunker prices were quoted lower on Thursday despite firm cargo prices, traders said. Demand were still thin as buyers were few. Some traders attribute the scarce demand on fewer ships docking in Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
